Non-affiliation

Sandtable is an independent, unofficial implementation. It is not affiliated
with, endorsed by, or sponsored by SPI or any current or former rights holder
of "The Campaign for North Africa". Names are used only to identify the game
that Sandtable implements.

The repository contains no original box art, logos, counter art, map or chart
images, scans, or rulebook pages. It does contain transcribed charts and
tables, unit rosters, and a map derived from third-party data, plus notes that
paraphrase rules with section citations. Rights-holder review of that
source-derived data has not been completed.

